<div class="legal-section">
  <h2>Rights request types</h2>
  <p>Access, correction, deletion, portability, restriction, objection, and consent withdrawal requests.</p>
</div>

<div class="legal-section">
  <h2>How to submit requests</h2>
  <p>Email <a href="#" data-rot13-mailto="uryyb@frpergpuvc.arg" data-subject="Privacy Request">our privacy team</a> with subject line "Privacy Request" and include sufficient context.</p>
</div>

<div class="legal-section">
  <h2>Identity verification</h2>
  <p>SecretChip may request verification details before processing to protect data from unauthorized disclosure.</p>
</div>

<div class="legal-section">
  <h2>Expected response timeline</h2>
  <p>SecretChip targets response within 30 days where legally required. Complex requests may require extensions.</p>
</div>

<div class="legal-section">
  <h2>Complaint route</h2>
  <p>If unresolved, you may contact your relevant data protection authority.</p>
</div>
